# Themes

- Support light and dark themes whenever possible
- Avoid hardcoded colors inside components
- Prefer semantic color tokens over raw color values
- Keep theme definitions separated by theme mode
- Centralize colors, spacing and design tokens
- Keep theme usage consistent across the application
- Ensure proper contrast and readability in both themes
- Prefer theme-aware components and styles
